<title>UK: LIFFE coffee March certified stocks at 4,008 lots.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee March certified stocks at 4,008 lots.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>LIFFE certified coffee stocks rose by a sharp 1,207 five-tonne lots to 4,008 lots in March from 2,801 in February, traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>There was no immediate confirmation from the London exchange. -- London newsroom +44 171 542 4985</p>
